<h2 class="group">特殊功能  </h2>
<h3 class="group">1. 上下文并行支持  </h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>虚拟块概念</strong>：<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">virtual_block_size = block_size * pcp_size * dcp_size</code> <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">context_parallel.md:31-33</span></li>
<li><strong>分布式存储</strong>：KV cache 按序列维度分片存储在不同设备上</li>
<li><strong>交错访问</strong>：通过 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">cp_kv_cache_interleave_size</code> 控制访问模式</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="group">2. 推测解码支持  </h3>
<p>为推测解码预留额外的块表空间 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">block_table.py:77-81</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span>duplicate_size = </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>  
</span><span></span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">if</span><span> self.pcp_world_size * self.dcp_world_size &gt; </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>:  
</span>    duplicate_size += num_speculative_tokens</code></pre></pre>
<h3 class="group">3. 内存优化  </h3>
<ul>
<li>使用 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">CpuGpuBuffer</code> 实现 CPU-GPU 零拷贝传输 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">block_table.py:237-242</span></li>
<li>支持 pin memory 加速传输</li>
<li>按需分配，避免内存浪费</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="group">Notes  </h2>
<ul>
<li><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">block_table.py</code> 是 vllm-ascend 实现 NPU 优化的关键组件，特别是对上下文并行的支持</li>
<li>混合块机制允许在不改变物理块大小的情况下优化 attention 计算</li>
