<p><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">reshape_and_cache</code> 方法负责将新计算的 key 和 value 张量存储到 KV cache 的指定位置，使用 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">slot_mapping</code> 来确定每个 token 对应的存储槽位。</p>
<h3 class="group">基础实现  </h3>
<p>在 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">attention_v1.py</code> 中的基础实现 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">attention_v1.py:622-651</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">def</span><span class="hljs-function"> </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(153, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">reshape_and_cache</span><span class="hljs-function">(</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">    self,  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">    key: torch.Tensor,  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">    value: torch.Tensor,  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">    kv_cache: </span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params" style="color: rgb(68, 85, 136); font-weight: bold;">Tuple</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">[torch.Tensor],  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">    attn_metadata: AscendMetadata,  
