<h3 class="group">MLA 的特殊处理  </h3>
<p>在 MLA（Multi-head Latent Attention）中，KV cache 的结构不同，需要分别处理 nope 和 rope 部分 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">mla_cp.py:336-342</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># MLA 存储分离的 KV 缓存  </span><span>
</span>torch_npu._npu_reshape_and_cache(key=kv_c_normed,  
                                 value=k_pe,  
<span>                                 key_cache=kv_cache[</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>],  </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># nope_cache  </span><span>
</span><span>                                 value_cache=kv_cache[</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>],  </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># rope_cache  </span><span>
</span>                                 slot_indices=slot_mapping)</code></pre></pre>
<h3 class="group">存储流程总结  </h3>
<ol>
<li><strong>准备阶段</strong>：从 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">attn_metadata</code> 中提取 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">slot_mapping</code></li>
<li><strong>数据切片</strong>：根据实际 token 数量切片 key/value 张量</li>
<li><strong>特殊处理</strong>：CP 模式可能需要通信（all_gather）来聚合分布式 KV</li>
<li><strong>调用 NPU 算子</strong>：使用 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">_npu_reshape_and_cache</code> 执行实际存储</li>
<li><strong>返回更新</strong>：返回可能被修改的 key/value 张量</li>
</ol>
<h2 class="group">Notes  </h2>
<ul>
<li><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">slot_mapping</code> 的值由 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">compute_slot_mapping</code> 预先计算，包含了块号和块内偏移的组合信息</li>
<li>CP 模式下，<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">slot_mapping</code> 可能包含 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">-1</code> 值，表示该 token 不存储在当前设备上</li>
<li>MLA 架构使用两个独立的 KV cache 张量来存储不同类型的数据</li>
<li>A5 设备使用专门的 <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">npu_scatter_pa_kv_cache</code> 算子进行优化</li>
</ul>
